{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_04C456EA","title":"Need Funds","entry":"Dlg_04C456EA::entry","exit":"Dlg_04C456EA::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F59E6378","articyId":"72057611218077583","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I hate to bother you, but I have been monitoring your finances and they are running critically low.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hate to bother you, but I have been monitoring your finances and they are running critically low.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30756","byteOffset":19515600,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_ABF2CE47","articyId":"72057611218077604","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That is how some see them. But if you want to grow or indeed run any of your businesses, I'm afraid you'll need to dirty your hands with MONEY.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That is how some see them. But if you want to grow or indeed run any of your businesses, I'm afraid you'll need to dirty your hands with MONEY.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48663","byteOffset":32746840,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_9270B81C","articyId":"72057611218077636","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"First, do not panic. I will help you increase your funds. You have two options.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"First, do not panic. I will help you increase your funds. You have two options.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52012","byteOffset":34092096,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_239ED284","articyId":"72057611218077664","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"You can get money quickly by visiting a loan shark. There is one in the LUZ. However, his help might come at a cost.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You can get money quickly by visiting a loan shark. There is one in the LUZ. However, his help might come at a cost.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2537.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20348","byteOffset":15582128,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_CF17A6B6","articyId":"72057611218077678","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"You increase your funds by working hard with what you have: fishing, farming and furniture. You can sell what you catch and grow, or trade in furniture you don't need. So... which is it to be?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You increase your funds by working hard with what you have: fishing, farming and furniture. You can sell what you catch and grow, or trade in furniture you don't need. So... which is it to be?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3111.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21092","byteOffset":15861104,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_DB640A21","articyId":"72057611218077717","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Very well. I will update your HUD with the details of a loan shark. His name is Calhoun. Tread carefully.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very well. I will update your HUD with the details of a loan shark. His name is Calhoun. Tread carefully.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4012.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31915","byteOffset":19954872,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_E330A7FD","articyId":"72057611218077725","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Very well. You should have everything you need to get started. Don't forget that traders in different areas might give better prices. Good luck!","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very well. You should have everything you need to get started. Don't forget that traders in different areas might give better prices. Good luck!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4012.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36165","byteOffset":28028152,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_FF476910","articyId":"72057611218077590","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Agh! What do I do?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Agh! What do I do?","TextSheVersion":"Agh! What do I do?","TextTheyVersion":"Agh! What do I do?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36162","byteOffset":28027272,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_74F1B680","articyId":"72057611218077596","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Lims are a tool of oppression designed to subjugate the masses.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Lims are a tool of oppression desi